{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%d photos": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 枚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld were kept separate because they have different names or appear together in the same photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件は統合しませんでした（別の名前が付いている、または同じ写真に一緒に写っているため）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A group with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ名前のグループが既にあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzing faces…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔を分析中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answers are applied right away, and the next overnight analysis uses them too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答はすぐに反映され、次回の夜間解析にも使われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are both of these “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらも「%@」さんですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are these the same person?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キャンセル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Children change a lot as they grow, so one child can end up as many entries. Confirm them together to merge them quickly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子どもは成長で顔が大きく変わるため、1人が多数に分かれることがあります。「まとめて確認」で一度にまとめられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Cover": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代表写真を選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Cover Photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代表写真を変更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the person to group “%@” with as the same person (e.g. a child across ages). Their photos will appear together. You can separate them later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」と同じ人物（例: 成長した子供）として束ねる相手を選びます。写真はまとめて表示され、後で解除できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean Up This Person…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人物を整理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear all": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択を解除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閉じる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud Share…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クラウド共有…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud Sharing": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クラウド共有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm together": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まとめて確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete Group": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グループを削除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete this group? People and their photos are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このグループを削除しますか？人物と写真には影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don’t group — these are different people": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "束ねない（別人でした）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Group": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グループを編集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Group…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グループを編集…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find more": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次を探す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding faces to review…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認する顔を探しています…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding similar people…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "似た人を探しています…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "束ねる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group as Same Person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物として束ねる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group as same person?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物として束ねますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group name (e.g. family, team)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グループ名（例: 家族、チーム）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group with": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物として束ねる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group with Another Person…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "別の人物と束ねる…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Groups collect several people into one album (a family, a team, an organization). Select at least 2 people.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複数の人物を 1 つのアルバムにまとめます（家族・チーム・組織など）。2 人以上選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is this “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この写真は「%@」さんですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」を残す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept as this person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人物として残す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading faces…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔を読み込んでいます…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading photos…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真を読み込んでいます…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage Faces": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔の管理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Members": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メンバー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merge %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件をまとめる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merged %lld entries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件をまとめました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merging…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まとめています…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New People Group": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しいピープルグループ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次の人へ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいえ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No photos for this person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人物の写真がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No split candidates": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分割候補は見つかりませんでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not this person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "別の人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not this person (don’t pick anyone)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人ではない（相手を選ばない）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この写真は「%@」ではない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing left to merge right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いまはまとめられるものはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to review right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いま確認するものはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or choose the correct person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "または正しい人物を選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピープル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes this face from the person. It becomes its own new person; the app learns from this so the mistake isn’t repeated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この顔を人物から外します。新しい人物になり、以後は同じ誤りを繰り返さないよう学習します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前を変更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename Person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前を変更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review People": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物を確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search people": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物を検索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select all": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべて選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分離"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate %lld groups": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 個のグループを分離"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate %lld groups into new people?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 個のグループを別の人物に分離しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate Grouped Person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "束ねを解除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show face only": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔だけ表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show people with at least": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピープルに載せる最小枚数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show whole photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真全体を表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スキップ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still scanning photos — more will appear as it progresses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真をスキャン中です。進むにつれて増えていきます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Cloud Sharing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クラウド共有を停止…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a face that isn’t this person. Choose “Not this person” to just remove it, or pick the correct person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人ではない顔をタップしてください。「この人ではない」を選ぶと相手を選ばず外せます。正しい人物を選んでもかまいません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the ones that are the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物の写真をタップして選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks! %lld answers recorded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ありがとうございます。%lld 件の回答を記録しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app applies what it learned during the next overnight analysis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学習した内容は次の夜間解析で反映されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same person may be split into several entries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物が複数に分かれていることがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These people have different names": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "別々の名前が付いています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which of these are the same person as above?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上の人物と同じ人はどれですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which of these are “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」はどれですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "はい"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answers teach the app — recognition improves as you review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答はアプリの学習に使われます。確認するほど認識が良くなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” and “%@” will be shown as the same person. You can separate them later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」と「%@」は同じ人物として表示されます。後で解除できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.1"
}